<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;</span><span style="color: #003e3e"><tt><strong><span class="odate time_1598767085 format_%25m.%25d">30 Aug 2020 05:58</span> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/persimmon2457" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5433455); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5433455&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609209852" alt="Persimmon2457" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5433455)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/persimmon2457" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5433455); return false;">Persimmon2457</a></span></strong></tt></span></p>

    
